<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>ElintPOS Android - Setup & Login Guide</title>
    <!--[if gte mso 9]>
    <xml>
        <w:WordDocument>
            <w:View>Print</w:View>
            <w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
            <w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/>
        </w:WordDocument>
    </xml>
    <![endif]-->
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #1f2937;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #104f32;
            font-size: 20pt;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #104f32;
            padding-bottom: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #104f32;
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-top: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .subtitle {
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 11pt;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .img-box {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 14px 0;
            background: #0f172a;
            padding: 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .img-box img {
            max-width: 580px;
            height: auto;
        }
        ul {
            margin-top: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .bold-green {
            color: #104f32;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .tip {
            background: #e8f5e9;
            border-left: 4px solid #104f32;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            font-size: 10.5pt;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>ElintPOS Android Setup & Login Guide</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Official Step-by-Step User Configuration Guide</div>

    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <h2>Step 1: App Boot & Initial Printer Setup Screen</h2>
    <p>Upon first launching the app after installation or storage reset, the system automatically opens the <strong>Printer Setup</strong> screen.</p>
    <div class="img-box">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Step 1: Printer Setup Screen" />
    </div>
    <ul>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Connection Box:</span> Choose printer interface type (Bluetooth, USB, LAN, TecMI K8) and printer model.</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Paper Spacing:</span> Configure blank paper margins (Top gap & Bottom gap) around each bill.</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">After the bill:</span> Select paper cutter action (Full cut, Partial cut, or Continue).</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Register Options:</span> Enable automated startup on device boot and receipt print dialog.</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <h2>Step 2: Select Connection Type & Printer Model</h2>
    <p>Tap the <strong>Type</strong> dropdown inside the Connection card to select your printer's connection interface.</p>
    <div class="img-box">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Step 2: Connection Type Selection" />
    </div>
    <ul>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Bluetooth:</span> Wireless external thermal receipt printers (58mm / 80mm). <em>(Bluetooth must be enabled.)</em></li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">USB:</span> Direct USB or OTG connection to thermal receipt printers.</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">LAN:</span> Network thermal printers connected over Wi-Fi / Ethernet (Port 9100).</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">TecMI K8:</span> For all-in-one POS terminals with built-in thermal printers.</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Model:</span> Select paper roll model (e.g., XP-80 for standard 80mm roll).</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <h2>Step 3: Select Printer, Test Print & Continue</h2>
    <p>The selected interface displays active printers in the <strong>Available printers</strong> list.</p>
    <div class="img-box">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Step 3: Select Printer and Continue" />
    </div>
    <ul>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Select Printer:</span> Tap your printer in the list (e.g. <em>TecMI K8 Built-in Printer</em> or paired Bluetooth device). The border turns green.</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Test print:</span> Tap <strong>Test print</strong> to verify paper feed, alignment, and print output.</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Continue:</span> Tap <strong>Continue</strong> button to save configuration permanently and proceed.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="tip">
        <strong>Permanent Persistence:</strong> The printer configuration is permanently stored in Android SharedPreferences. This setup screen is skipped on subsequent app launches.
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4 -->
    <h2>Step 4: POS Sign In & Start Billing</h2>
    <p>After setup confirmation, the app immediately transitions to the <strong>ElintPOS Sign In</strong> page.</p>
    <div class="img-box">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Step 4: POS Login Screen" />
    </div>
    <ul>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Username:</span> Enter your credentials (e.g., <code>Admin</code>).</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Password:</span> Enter your password (e.g., <code>Admin@554</code>).</li>
        <li><span class="bold-green">Log In:</span> Click <strong>Log In</strong> button to open the active POS billing dashboard!</li>
    </ul>

</body>
</html>
